---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About — Rushal S. | Marketing × Technology × Creativity"
  description="Bridging the gap between engineering rigor and creative communication. Demand Generation Specialist, founder of Gazette Collective, and event manager."
>
  <div class="max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-8 lg:py-12">
    
    <!-- Top Context Ribbon -->
    <section class="pb-4 mb-8 border-b border-[#1B1B18]/15">
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 text-xs font-sans">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-white bg-[#1F3A3D] px-2 py-0.5 rounded">
            Dossier / Vol. 04
          </span>
          <span class="text-[#1B1B18]/40">•</span>
          <span class="text-[#1B1B18]/80 font-medium">Rushal S.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-[#1B1B18]/70">
          <span>Udaipur × Hybrid</span>
          <span>•</span>
          <span>Marketing • Technology • Creativity</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Hero Editorial Frame: Asymmetric Stage -->
    <section class="pb-16 border-b border-[#1B1B18]/15">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 lg:gap-12 items-start">
        
        <!-- Left Column (7 cols) -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-7 flex flex-col justify-between space-y-8">
          <div class="space-y-3">
            <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#C1592B]"></span>
              <span class="font-sans text-[12px] uppercase tracking-wider text-[#C1592B] font-bold">
                Mandate &amp; Profile
              </span>
            </div>
            <h1 class="font-serif text-[42px] sm:text-[54px] text-[#1B1B18] tracking-tight leading-[1.05] font-normal">
              About
            </h1>
            <p class="font-serif text-[22px] sm:text-[26px] text-[#1B1B18] font-normal pt-1 leading-snug">
              Bridging the gap between engineering rigor and creative communication.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Core Thesis Quote -->
          <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-lg border-l-4 border-[#C1592B] border border-[#E6E1D8] space-y-2 shadow-sm">
            <span class="font-sans text-[11px] uppercase tracking-widest text-[#1F3A3D] font-bold block">
              Core Thesis
            </span>
            <p class="font-serif text-[18px] text-[#1B1B18] italic leading-relaxed">
              “Most modern silos force a false truce: either you build the system or you craft its voice. I operate on the premise that high-conviction products require one unified nervous system.”
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Key Vital Stats -->
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4 pt-2">
            <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded border border-[#E6E1D8]">
              <span class="font-sans text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider text-[#1B1B18]/60 block font-semibold">Primary Role</span>
              <span class="font-serif text-[20px] text-[#1B1B18] block mt-0.5 font-normal">Demand Gen</span>
              <span class="font-sans text-[12px] text-[#1F3A3D] font-medium">Scale &amp; Precision</span>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded border border-[#E6E1D8]">
              <span class="font-sans text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider text-[#1B1B18]/60 block font-semibold">Initiative</span>
              <span class="font-serif text-[20px] text-[#1B1B18] block mt-0.5 font-normal">Gazette</span>
              <span class="font-sans text-[12px] text-[#1F3A3D] font-medium">Founder &amp; Editor</span>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded border border-[#E6E1D8]">
              <span class="font-sans text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider text-[#1B1B18]/60 block font-semibold">Ecosystem</span>
              <span class="font-serif text-[20px] text-[#1B1B18] block mt-0.5 font-normal">DevFest ’24</span>
              <span class="font-sans text-[12px] text-[#1F3A3D] font-medium">Operations Lead</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Right Column: Physical Archival Photo Container (5 cols) -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-5 flex flex-col space-y-4">
          <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-lg border border-[#E6E1D8] shadow-editorial group">
            
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-2 border-b border-[#1B1B18]/10 mb-3 text-[11px] font-sans text-[#1B1B18]">
              <span class="flex items-center gap-1 font-semibold text-[#C1592B]">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[15px]">verified_user</span>
                VERIFIED ARCHIVE
              </span>
              <span class="font-mono text-[#1F3A3D] uppercase">ARCHIVE #2024-RS</span>
            </div>

            <div class="relative aspect-[4/5] w-full overflow-hidden rounded bg-[#F0EDE8] border border-[#1B1B18]/15">
              <img
                src="/assets/images/rushal-portrait.jpg"
                alt="Portrait of Rushal S. — Real photo placeholder, strictly not AI generated"
                class="w-full h-full object-cover"
              />
            </div>

            <div class="pt-3 space-y-1">
              <p class="font-sans text-[11px] text-[#C1592B] uppercase tracking-widest font-semibold">
                [Photo of Rushal S. — Real photo placeholder, not AI generated]
              </p>
              <p class="font-sans text-[13px] text-[#1B1B18]/80 leading-relaxed">
                Working at the juncture of code repos, editorial printing layouts, and high-velocity digital marketing frameworks.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-center justify-between px-4 py-2.5 bg-white rounded border border-[#E6E1D8] text-[#1B1B18]/80 font-sans text-[12px]">
            <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px] text-[#1F3A3D]">terminal</span>
              <span>Python • React • Markdown</span>
            </span>
            <span class="font-mono text-[#1F3A3D]">24.5854° N, 73.7125° E</span>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Detailed Personal Narrative Sections -->
    <section class="py-16">
      <div class="max-w-[720px] mx-auto space-y-12 font-sans">
        
        <!-- Chapter 1: The Intersection -->
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <span class="font-sans text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#C1592B]">
            01 — Background
          </span>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-[30px] sm:text-[34px] text-[#1B1B18] font-normal leading-snug">
            How I ended up at the intersection of technology and storytelling
          </h2>
          <div class="text-[16px] text-[#1B1B18]/80 space-y-4 leading-relaxed">
            <p>
              Most career advice suggests choosing a lane: become an engineer who leaves marketing to the sales team, or become a marketer who treats technology as an external utility. I never found that division natural or honest.
            </p>
            <p>
              When you learn how databases query, how APIs throttle, and how git branches manage complexity, your understanding of communication fundamentally shifts. You stop relying on superficial slogans. You start framing product capabilities with precision, clarity, and genuine empathy for what is physically possible beneath the glass.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Chapter 2: What I Do -->
        <div class="space-y-4 pt-8 border-t border-[#1B1B18]/15">
          <span class="font-sans text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#C1592B]">
            02 — Operational Practice
          </span>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-[30px] sm:text-[34px] text-[#1B1B18] font-normal leading-snug">
            Demand generation and distribution architecture
          </h2>
          <div class="text-[16px] text-[#1B1B18]/80 space-y-4 leading-relaxed">
            <p>
              As a Demand Generation Specialist, my focus is constructing sustainable acquisition systems that compound organically over time. I specialize in multi-channel attribution frameworks, conversion funnel optimization, content ecosystems, and high-retention audience mechanics.
            </p>
            <p>
              Rather than chasing short-term viral spikes that vanish overnight, I build defensible distribution channels rooted in query intent, organic search, and genuine community engagement.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Chapter 3: What I Build Outside -->
        <div class="space-y-4 pt-8 border-t border-[#1B1B18]/15">
          <span class="font-sans text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#C1592B]">
            03 — Community &amp; Collectives
          </span>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-[30px] sm:text-[34px] text-[#1B1B18] font-normal leading-snug">
            Empowering regional voices and civic assembly
          </h2>
          <div class="text-[16px] text-[#1B1B18]/80 space-y-4 leading-relaxed">
            <p>
              Outside client and enterprise work, I invest my energy into grassroots community infrastructure. Through the Gazette Collective, we run decentralized civic newsrooms that train young writers, university students, and women fellows in slow, investigative journalism.
            </p>
            <p>
              In 2024, I led operations for Google DevFest Udaipur, assembling 850+ developers and 18 technical speakers to prove that Tier-2 cities in Rajasthan can host broadcast-grade technical summits without corporate event agencies.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Chapter 4: How I Work -->
        <div class="space-y-4 pt-8 border-t border-[#1B1B18]/15">
          <span class="font-sans text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#C1592B]">
            04 — Work Values
          </span>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-[30px] sm:text-[34px] text-[#1B1B18] font-normal leading-snug">
            Speed, literate craftsmanship, and high agency
          </h2>
          <div class="text-[16px] text-[#1B1B18]/80 space-y-4 leading-relaxed">
            <p>
              I respect small, high-density teams who prioritize working software and real customer conversations over endless planning committees. I believe documentation beats verbal confusion under pressure, and that authentic respect for the audience's time is the only lasting marketing advantage.
            </p>
          </div>
          
          <div class="pt-4">
            <a
              href="/philosophy"
              class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 font-sans text-[14px] text-[#C1592B] font-semibold hover:underline"
            >
              <span>Read the full operating philosophy</span>
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">east</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Closing Action Banner -->
        <div class="pt-8 border-t border-[#1B1B18]/15 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4">
          <div class="space-y-1 text-center sm:text-left">
            <h4 class="font-serif text-[20px] text-[#1B1B18]">Ready to build together?</h4>
            <p class="font-sans text-[13px] text-[#1B1B18]/70">Explore collaborative avenues or view past project proof.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <a
              href="/collaborate"
              class="inline-flex items-center justify-center bg-[#C1592B] text-white font-sans text-[13px] font-medium px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity shadow-sm"
            >
              Collaborate
            </a>
            <a
              href="/work"
              class="inline-flex items-center justify-center bg-white border border-[#1B1B18]/20 text-[#1B1B18] font-sans text-[13px] font-medium px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg hover:border-[#1B1B18] transition-colors"
            >
              See my work
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

  </div>
</BaseLayout>
